{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12089","headline":"送崔校书从军 · 钱起","name":"送崔校书从军","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雁门太守能爱贤，麟阁书生亦投笔。\n宁唯玉劒报知己，更有龙韬佐师律。\n别马连嘶出御沟，家人几夜望刀头。\n燕南春草伤心色，蓟北黄云满眼愁。\n闻道轻生能击虏，何嗟少壮不封侯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12089.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12089","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}